First I would take a look at the debugging guide, so that you learn how to report bugs in this context. Unfortunately the console output is not very often sufficient to solve a problem. In your case, guessing from file name extensions, you are reading a CSV file without specifying the format, so I'd read about the input.format argument to mapreduce and the make.input.format function. It seems to me this would be a very difficult package to use just going by intuition. The manual is there to be read.

