I discoverd my error, I was ponting to the sources of streaming
Sys.setenv(HADOOP_STREAMING = "/usr/local/hadoop/share/hadoop/tools/sources/hadoop-streaming-2.6.0-sources.jar")

but instead I had to point to the assembled libs
Sys.setenv(HADOOP_STREAMING = "/usr/local/hadoop/share/hadoop/tools/lib/hadoop-streaming-2.6.0.jar")

Thanks for your answer.

P.S. I am using version 3.3.1.

